# Jhana Absorption (Deep Theta) — ~35 min — alpha 10 settle -> descend 10->6 Hz -> long flat 6 Hz absorption -> return 10
# Goal: scaffold deep concentrative (jhana-like) absorption: a very steady, minimal-change theta
#       hold that supports single-pointed attention. Stillness over stimulation.
# Bands: alpha 10 Hz settle; slow descent 10->6 Hz; LONG flat theta absorption 6 Hz (16 min);
#        gentle return 6->10 Hz. Deliberately NO gamma.
# Evidence note: deep absorption shows frontal-midline THETA rising while central beta and
#        low-gamma power DECREASE (Hagerty jhana EEG; Katyal & Goldin 2021). So we hold low theta
#        and never push high frequencies. This is scaffolding for a practice, not a shortcut to
#        jhana — the state comes from the practitioner's attention, not the device.
# Driver: binaural (gentle, low content). freq_r FIXED at 260 Hz; the beat slides by ramping the
#        carrier 250->254 Hz (beat = freq_r - carrier), per guidelines 5a (freq_r is NOT
#        interpolatable). During the hold a gentle 6 Hz ISOCHRONIC pulse (mod=6) is layered 1:1
#        with the binaural 6 Hz and the 6 Hz light for a steadier, quiet lock.
# LED: dim deep violet, flicker tracks the beat 1:1 (all <=10 Hz, safe), slow breathing
#      brightness LFO (sine 10<->30% over 12 s), four zones (mask 15).
# SAFETY: every rate <=10 Hz (below the 15-25 Hz photosensitive band); binaural carrier 250 Hz
#      (<1000), L/R offset = beat <=10 Hz (<35); brightness capped <=30% with a 10% floor; light
#      ramps in 20 s and fades out 60 s (both >=15 s), never stopped abruptly; deep violet only
#      (no saturated red, no red<->blue). Eyes-closed, seated. Not a medical device; do not use if
#      photosensitive/epileptic. Stop if unwell.
#
# Ramp convention = animate-on-start (5a): the > prefix sits on the row where a segment BEGINS;
# its value is the start; the target is the next same-channel/field row's value, swept over the gap.

# --- Settle / alpha induction (00:00-06:00, beat 10 Hz): vol + light fade in ---
0 10 50 >0 60 0 180 15   # LED 10 Hz flicker, deep violet, brightness ramps 0->20% over 20 s
A 0 250 0 >0 0 1 260 0           # ch1 binaural: carrier 250 / freq_r 260 => 10 Hz beat; vol fades 0->45 over 45 s
S 5000 default 10 "Settle. Let the body grow heavy and still, the breath slow and easy."
20000 10 50 20 60 0 180 15   # brightness reaches 20% (ramp-in >=15 s satisfied)
45000 10 50 ~10:30:12000 60 0 180 15   # breathing LFO engages: brightness sine 10<->30% over 12 s
A 45000 250 0 90 0 1 260 0       # vol settled 45 (~45 s fade-in); beat steady 10 Hz

# --- Slow descent alpha -> theta (06:00-14:00, beat 10->6 Hz, ~0.5 Hz/min) ---
A 360000 >250 0 90 0 1 260 0     # carrier ramp START 250 -> (target 254 at 14:00) => beat 10->6
360000 >10 50 ~10:30:12000 60 0 180 15   # LED flicker tracks beat 10->6, breathing continues
S 360000 default 10 "Rest your attention on the breath. Let it grow still and bright."

# --- Theta absorption hold (14:00-30:00 = 16 min, beat 6 Hz, isochronic layered): the core ---
A 840000 254 0 90 6 1 260 0      # carrier fixed 254 => binaural 6 Hz; 6 Hz isochronic pulse added 1:1; very steady
840000 6 50 ~10:30:12000 55 0 170 15   # deep violet, 6 Hz flicker, gentle breathing LFO
S 840000 default 10 "Six hertz. Let attention merge with the stillness. Nothing to do, nowhere to go."
S 1320000 default 10 "Abide here, quiet and luminous. Let each breath deepen the absorption."

# --- Gentle return theta -> alpha (30:00-34:00, beat 6->10 Hz, soft) ---
A 1800000 >254 0 90 >6 1 260 0   # return: carrier 254->250 (beat 6->10); isochronic pulse 6->0 (fades out)
1800000 >6 50 ~10:30:12000 55 0 170 15   # LED 6->10 lockstep, breathing continues
S 1800000 default 10 "Slowly rising now, letting the light and breath carry you toward waking calm."

# --- Soft close (34:00-35:00): vol + brightness fade to 0 ---
A 2040000 250 0 >90 0 1 260 0    # beat back at alpha 10 Hz; vol ramps 45->0 over final 60 s
2040000 10 50 >20 60 0 180 15   # brightness fades 20->0 (>=15 s), preempts LFO
S 2040000 default 10 "Back at ten hertz. Gently return to the room, calm, clear, and refreshed."
A 2100000 250 0 0 0 1 260 0      # end: volume 0
2100000 10 50 0 60 0 180 15   # end: brightness 0

S 2100000 default 20 "WAKE UP!"
S 2110000 default 40 "WAKE UP!"
S 2120000 default 50 "WAKE UP!"
S 2130000 default 60 "WAKE UP!"
